# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local database
#
# data/air4.db is the working copy: it holds Air4's own decisions — connection
# reviews, progress, layout and the full audit history — and is rebuilt on a new
# machine with `npm run seed` from data/source/. It is not source code and does
# not belong in the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*.db
data/*.db-journal
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
data/backups/
data/test/
